        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/4b9b08b90d3320f3a8faf73ecf989b99.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/8e68fa83f8e5a179cfd956a435547eaa.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/9f0d5c8b9ac9a8ee50e5ec1ecbce094d.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/2f27e7637370a970ab1eb874879f21ee.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit <i>Amborettio</i>, Wanech transformed his trusty C.A.N. into a cozy green-themed pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings. The place hums with synthwave tracks, punctuated by chiptune sound effects, giving it a playful retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>top-down, casual cooking sim with arcade twists</strong>, you’ll serve hungry customers by cooking food in a unique way: as meals rain down the screen, hit the correct <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> keys in sequence to prepare each order. Master the rhythm of the kitchen and deliver every plate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody really knows why Wanech traded adventure for appetizers—though rumor has it, it’s all to raise awareness for <i>Amborettio</i>. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: keep the pub buzzing, the customers smiling, and the orders flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/4b9b08b90d3320f3a8faf73ecf989b99.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/8e68fa83f8e5a179cfd956a435547eaa.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/9f0d5c8b9ac9a8ee50e5ec1ecbce094d.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/2f27e7637370a970ab1eb874879f21ee.webp?t=1757492220\" width=42 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit <i>Amborettio</i>, Wanech transformed his trusty C.A.N. into a cozy green-themed pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings. The place hums with synthwave tracks, punctuated by chiptune sound effects, giving it a playful retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>top-down, casual cooking sim with arcade twists</strong>, you’ll serve hungry customers by cooking food in a unique way: as meals rain down the screen, hit the correct <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> keys in sequence to prepare each order. Master the rhythm of the kitchen and deliver every plate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody really knows why Wanech traded adventure for appetizers—though rumor has it, it’s all to raise awareness for <i>Amborettio</i>. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: keep the pub buzzing, the customers smiling, and the orders flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>",
        "short_description": "Wanech’s C.A.N. becomes a retro green pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings to synthwave beats. In this top-down cooking sim, prep meals by hitting W/A/S/D in sequence as orders rain down. Keep plates moving, customers smiling, and the pub buzzing!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“Free typing game. Reach day 25. Serve 27 customers one day (RNG). Everything else comes naturally on a way to 10k correct WASD inputs (scriptable) ~1.5h to 100%”<br>100% Achievements Collector<br><br>“Stress-free Diner Dash. Buffet of killer beats without consequences! Works as intended but is it really working!? Leaves you starving for more stuffing... Still, how fast C.A.N ya make it to the end~”<br>DaRevieweD<br>",
